ted_text to the entire reading, and reason to JSON null (not a string). Do not add a completion comment such as \"No further action required.\" For an incomplete or uncertain reading, set coverage to \"incomplete\", corrected_text to JSON null, and reason to a nonempty explanation. Never provide a complete reading while reporting uncertainty.\n\nSource-boundary rule: If the assigned text ends in a word cut off by the registered crop, return coverage \"incomplete\", corrected_text null, and a concrete reason. Do not infer or append unseen letters from language probability. Preserve supported historical wording and fully visible line continuations; do not silently extend the assigned target beyond the image.\n\nWhen a word is divided across two printed lines solely because the line ends, join its visible parts into one word in the corrected reading. Preserve genuine compound-word hyphens and punctuation dashes. Use the image and the full assigned target to distinguish these cases; do not invent missing letters or continue beyond the assigned target.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context_regions\":[],\"contract\":\"ocr-productive-repair-input-v3\",\"diagnostics\":{\"configuration_sha256\":\"ad7a7cb96d33db1b2850f5504fbd16933330e1b81d4b22f92b3c68b42cd6a385\",\"detector_sha256\":\"0f06e3a8bd1c8b7a14175b5610f3127e05934e138831252d300eb86dbf9a4509\",\"negative_targets\":[],\"signals\":[{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"name_list_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":11,\"raw_quote\":\"BALDWIN\",\"raw_start\":4,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"6d72834b4772fb9b36f3e265017788e3e3ad51855b9590231d880b975a56f888\"},{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"post_repair_word_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":52,\"raw_quote\":\"words\",\"raw_start\":47,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"2ee307789f4